---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const lastUpdated = 'November 18, 2026';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Lou's Heating & Cooling"
  description="How Lou's Heating & Cooling uses enquiry information and optional website and advertising measurement, and how to manage your choices."
  canonical="/privacy/"
>
  <section class="page-hero section-primary section-sm">
    <div class="container text-center">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p>Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container-narrow legal-copy">
      <p>This policy explains how Lou's Heating &amp; Cooling handles information from this website and service enquiries. You can call us or submit an enquiry whether optional measurement is on or off.</p>

      <h2>Information You Provide</h2>
      <p>Our contact form requires your name and phone number. You may also provide an email address, selected service, message and preferred contact time. We use these details to respond, discuss your needs and arrange service. If you do not provide an email address, we do not send a customer confirmation email. Please do not include payment-card details or other sensitive information in the message.</p>
      <p>The website may also process technical information such as the source page, browser information and a hashed IP-based identifier to operate the service and reduce spam. Our hosting provider processes request information needed to deliver and protect the website.</p>

      <h2>Website and Advertising Measurement</h2>
      <p>We use Google Tag Manager to manage Google Ads and Google Analytics measurement. When measurement is permitted, Google may process information about page visits, browser or device characteristics, advertising interactions and measurement identifiers, and use that data for advertising measurement. Our website events describe accepted contact enquiries and the location of telephone-link clicks; they do not include the name, phone number, email address or free-text message entered in the form.</p>
      <p>This measurement setup disables enhanced-conversion matching of contact-form details and ad-personalization signals. Telephone-link clicks are measured separately from connected calls. Calls made through Google advertising features may also be subject to Google's call-reporting practices.</p>
      <p>When measurement is permitted, we also save advertising click identifiers (GCLID, GBRAID and WBRAID) and campaign labels (UTM parameters) in first-party browser storage for up to 90 days. If you send an enquiry while measurement is on, these identifiers and labels accompany the enquiry email so our team can understand its source and reconcile service outcomes. We do not add your form contact details to these campaign fields. Turning measurement off removes this optional attribution from your browser and excludes it from future submissions; it does not automatically delete an enquiry already received.</p>
      <p>For more about Google's processing, see <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">how Google uses information from sites that use its services</a>.</p>

      <h2>Call Measurement</h2>
      <p>When measurement is permitted, calls from ad visitors may route through a Google forwarding number to Lou's usual business line. Google's call reporting measures information such as call time, duration and caller area code. A tap on a telephone link is measured separately and does not establish that a call connected or service was booked.</p>

      <h2>Your Measurement Choices</h2>
      <p>Optional measurement is on by default for eligible U.S. visits unless a saved choice or Global Privacy Control signal turns it off. For other or unrecognized locations, it remains off until you choose to allow it. We use a limited location-policy response from our hosting platform; the settings response does not include your precise location.</p>
      <p>Use <strong>Measurement settings</strong> in the footer to turn optional measurement on or off. Your explicit choice is stored in your browser until you change it or clear that storage. If browser storage is unavailable, measurement is off by default and a choice may apply only to the current page.</p>
      <p>Turning measurement off stops our optional website events and prevents Google tags from loading on later pages. If Google's code has already loaded on the current page, it may send limited cookieless consent or measurement signals until you leave or refresh. Existing browser Global Privacy Control signals are respected and prevent the optional loader from starting.</p>
      <p>Measurement settings do not disable the contact form, telephone links or storage needed for the site's basic operation. Browsers with JavaScript disabled can still submit the form, but do not run the JavaScript measurement controls or enquiry event.</p>

      <h2>Service Providers and Business Records</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Netlify</strong> hosts the website and runs its server-side functionality.</li>
        <li><strong>Resend</strong> delivers enquiry notifications and confirmation emails.</li>
        <li><strong>Google</strong> provides the optional advertising-measurement services described above.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Website enquiries reach Lou's team by email with a unique enquiry reference. The team uses its business records and Housecall Pro to manage enquiries, appointments and service outcomes. Matching an enquiry to a Housecall Pro job is a staff workflow, not an automatic website-to-Housecall-Pro API connection.</p>

      <h2>Retention and Requests</h2>
      <p>We retain enquiry and service information as needed to respond, provide service, maintain business records and meet applicable obligations. To ask about your information or request access, correction or deletion, email <a href="mailto:admin@loushvac.com">admin@loushvac.com</a>. Some records may need to be retained for service or legal reasons.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about this policy? Call <a href="tel:+13039498584">(303) 949-8584</a> or email <a href="mailto:admin@loushvac.com">admin@loushvac.com</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
.legal-copy h2 { margin-top: var(--space-8); margin-bottom: var(--space-3); color: var(--color-primary); }
.legal-copy p, .legal-copy ul { color: var(--color-text-muted); line-height: 1.8; }
.legal-copy ul { padding-left: var(--space-5); }
.legal-copy li { margin-bottom: var(--space-2); }
.legal-copy a { color: var(--color-primary); }
</style>
